# Student Management Portal - Product Backlog

## Project Description
The Student Management Portal is a web-based application used to manage student information.

## Product Backlog

| ID | User Story | Priority | Story Points |
|---|---|---|---|
| US01 | As an administrator, I want to add student details. | High | 5 |
| US02 | As an administrator, I want to view student records. | High | 3 |
| US03 | As an administrator, I want to update student details. | Medium | 3 |
| US04 | As an administrator, I want to delete student records. | Medium | 3 |
| US05 | As a student, I want to view my profile. | Medium | 5 |
| US06 | As an administrator, I want to manage attendance. | Medium | 5 |
| US07 | As an administrator, I want to generate student reports. | Low | 8 |

## Prioritization
High-priority features will be implemented first, followed by medium- and low-priority features.

## Conclusion
The product backlog helps the development team organize, prioritize, and track the features required for the Student Management Portal.
